WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.514
Namaste. Is video mein hum The Ray ko Jewellery ki dukaan ke liye step by step use karenge.

00:00:06.514 --> 00:00:09.378
Ye public demo dummy data par based hai.

00:00:09.378 --> 00:00:21.691
Jewellery billing mein sone chandi ka roz badalta rate, wajan, wastage aur making charge sabse zaroori inputs hain, aur purana gehna lene ka exchange bhi bill ka hissa hai.

00:00:22.065 --> 00:00:28.698
Sabse pehle aaj ka rate. Rate screen par sone ka rate per gram aur chandi ka rate per gram likhte hain.

00:00:28.698 --> 00:00:31.338
Neeche pichhle dinon ke rate ki list hai.

00:00:31.338 --> 00:00:36.362
Hum sone ka rate saat hazaar chaar sau pachaas likh kar Save karte hain. Kyun?

00:00:36.362 --> 00:00:44.476
Kyunki rate roz badalta hai, aur ek baar likhne se din bhar ke har bill mein wahi rate lagta hai, alag alag nahi likhna padta.

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:48.877
Ab bill. Sell par Add jewellery item by weight dabate hain.

00:00:48.877 --> 00:00:55.309
Item ka naam Gold ring, hallmark ya H U I D number, metal gold, wajan saadhe chaar gram. Kyun?

00:00:55.309 --> 00:01:00.851
Kyunki H U I D ab hallmark ka kanooni number hai, aur bill mein hona zaroori hai.

00:01:01.218 --> 00:01:07.925
Making charge chahe per gram, chahe fixed rupaye, chahe percentage, jaise dukaan ka tarika ho.

00:01:07.925 --> 00:01:13.276
Hum chaar sau pachaas rupaye per gram aur wastage chhe percent likhte hain.

00:01:13.276 --> 00:01:19.484
Neeche breakup dikhta hai: metal ki value, wastage, making, aur teen percent GST. Kyun?

00:01:19.484 --> 00:01:25.549
Kyunki customer ko dikhna chahiye ki kis cheez ka kitna, aur ye jhagda kam karta hai.

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:30.895
Item cart mein aa gaya, aur amount ban gaya. Ab Complete bill.

00:01:30.895 --> 00:01:36.192
Yahan ek khaas button hai: Customer exchanging old gold ya silver.

00:01:36.192 --> 00:01:42.291
Customer apna purana gehna laaya hai, use is button se bill mein jodte hain.

00:01:42.668 --> 00:01:45.242
Purane gehne ka naam, Old gold chain.

00:01:45.242 --> 00:01:51.571
Wajan teen gram, purity ikyanve point chhe percent, yaani baaees carat, aur us din ka rate.

00:01:51.571 --> 00:01:59.083
App net wajan aur uski kimat nikal kar Apply to payment dabate hi bill ke payment mein ghata deta hai. Kyun?

00:01:59.083 --> 00:02:06.039
Kyunki exchange ka hisaab haath se karne mein galti hoti hai, aur yahan wo saaf record ban jata hai.

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:13.718
Baaki payment ke liye Fully paid aur method chuno. Exchange ka amount pehle hi kat chuka hai.

00:02:13.718 --> 00:02:15.997
Generate invoice dabate hain.

00:02:15.997 --> 00:02:23.541
Invoice mein exchange ki line alag dikhti hai, taaki customer aur aapka record dono saaf rahein.

00:02:24.798 --> 00:02:26.035
Exchange History.

00:02:26.035 --> 00:02:39.129
Jitna purana sona ya chandi customers se liya, uska total wajan aur total value upar, aur neeche har entry: kitna wajan, kitni purity, net wajan, kitne ki value, aur kis bill mein.

00:02:39.129 --> 00:02:42.985
View bill par tap karo to wahi bill khulta hai. Kyun?

00:02:42.985 --> 00:02:49.969
Kyunki purana sona dukaan ka stock banta hai, aur uska hisaab saal ke end mein zaroori hota hai.

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:51.001
Products.

00:02:51.001 --> 00:03:00.117
Coins, bars aur silver ke articles jaise fixed cheezein yahan alag se hain, jinka rate aur GST tay hai, jaise Gold Coin do gram.

00:03:00.117 --> 00:03:05.103
Jo gehna wajan se bikta hai, wo seedha bill mein bana lete hain. Kyun?

00:03:05.103 --> 00:03:09.091
Kyunki dono tarah ka saaman ek hi dukaan mein bikta hai.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:15.205
Aur Dashboard: aaj ki bikri, kitna udhaar aana hai, aur festival reminder.

00:03:15.205 --> 00:03:24.051
Dhanteras ya Akshaya Tritiya jaise mauke par jewellery ki bikri sabse zyada hoti hai, aur app pehle se yaad dila deta hai.

00:03:24.434 --> 00:03:35.754
Aaj humne Jewellery ka flow dekha: roz ka rate, wajan aur wastage aur making ke saath bill, H U I D, purane gehne ka exchange, exchange history, aur products.

00:03:35.754 --> 00:03:41.343
Ek practical baat: subah dukaan kholte hi aaj ka rate Rate screen par likh do.

00:03:41.343 --> 00:03:44.925
Baaki poora din har bill khud sahi rate se banega.
